{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just Press The Button</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through the levels, pressing the buttons as they appear to zoom out and see more of your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push levers to move platforms and walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to higher points by jumping into pipes or bouncing on trampolines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk passed arrows to pan across the screen and discover more at the current zoom level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn fans on and off to get to blocked areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851500/extras/57a1d68f4235b1160c9be39941d507d3.poster.avif?t=1766156720\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851500/extras/57a1d68f4235b1160c9be39941d507d3.webm?t=1766156720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851500/extras/57a1d68f4235b1160c9be39941d507d3.mp4?t=1766156720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851500?t=1766156720","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851500?t=1766156720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851500/f69c468f23e1e03b1cccce575c6b349c44542f20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766156720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851500/f69c468f23e1e03b1cccce575c6b349c44542f20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766156720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"note